      "keyInsight": "Seeing ten thousand white swans does not prove that every swan on earth is white. Yet seeing just one black swan destroys the rule forever.\n\nMost leaders run businesses entirely in reverse. They hunt relentlessly for tiny scraps of praise that confirm their pet projects.\n\nThey stack up customer compliments and ignore the silent churn leaking out the back door. Negative evidence carries far more punch than positive proof.\n\nOne hidden flaw can sink an unsinkable ship. A master tactician never asks, 'How can I prove this strategy works?' They ask, 'What single quiet crack would break this business model wide open tomorrow?' Disproof is absolute; validation is just temporary comfort.",
